WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
SceneFoundry / Photo to Roblox
A manual-first beta for turning a real place into an editable Roblox world.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
01 / Start with your photographs
Send 1–3 photos you may use and a brief. An operator reviews the request.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
02 / A new open-data case study
OSM vectors → procedural geometry → browser preview → editable .rbxlx.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
03 / Springer Park, Burnaby
440 × 290 metres · 20 building footprints · 5,682 editable parts.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:50.000
04 / Inspect the details
Approximate facades and decorative planting. No Google imagery or customer photos.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
05 / From demonstration to release
Next gates: Roblox Studio Play, durable storage, email and payment QA.
